    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "During a failing Gu refinement, Fang Yuan throws clear water Gu into the fire after chimney smoke Gu. The baby phantom in the fire devours it. Clear water Gu turns into a lump of emerald green water the fire cannot evaporate, the fire dims to orange-yellow, and the water and fire circulate until Fang Yuan’s blood finishes the improvised sequence that yields sneak attack Gu.",
